<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<%- include('../partials/simple-hero', { eyebrow: 'Transparency' }) %>
<section class="section section-tight">
  <div class="wrap prose-page">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>How we make money</h2>
      <p>BuildNReview is free to read. We pay for the site through affiliate links: when you click a "Check price" or "Shop" button and buy something, the retailer may pay us a small commission. The price you pay is the same.</p>
      <p>We are a member of the Snapmaker affiliate program. Links to us.snapmaker.com include our referral code, and the "Maker pick" box on our reviews promotes Snapmaker products.</p>

      <h2>What it does not change</h2>
      <p>Commissions never decide a score, a ranking or a verdict. Products without an affiliate program are reviewed and recommended in exactly the same way, and we will tell you when a cheaper or better product exists, even if we earn nothing from it.</p>

      <h2>How to spot affiliate links</h2>
      <p>Affiliate links on this site go through a short <code>/go/</code> address and are marked as sponsored to search engines. Every review page also carries a short disclosure near the top.</p>

      <p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:<%= settings.contact_email %>"><%= settings.contact_email %></a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<%- include('../partials/foot') %>
